      "content": "thanks, that sounds great for the high-level pitch deck. but i need more than just \"significant resonance\" to actually close this deal. the partners are going to be looking for hard evidence that we didn't just hit the older demographics but actually cracked the code with the younger crowd too.\n\ncan you give me a specific breakdown of the engagement percentages for the 18-24, 25-40, and 45+ segments? we really need the numbers to look strong and consistent across the board so they see the scale of our reach and how effective we are at multi-generational engagement.",
